<title>USA: First Union Corp Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>First Union Corp Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			   $1.66		    $1.19</p>
<p> Net			 460,000		  435,000</p>
<p> Net int income	1,272,000		1,190,000</p>
<p> Loan loss prov	  120,000		   64,000</p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			   $5.35		    $5.04</p>
<p> Net		     1,499,000		1,430,000</p>
<p> Net int income	5,080,000		4,740,000</p>
<p> Loan loss prov	  375,000		  220,000</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: EPS excluding restructuring charges and SAIF assessment were $1.66 vs $1.45 for Q4, and $6.31 vs $5.30 for year.</p>
<p>Total assets at current period end were $140.1 bln.</p>
</text>
